<title>CANADA: Canada C$3.5 bln bond due 1999 yields 4.823 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$3.5 bln bond due 1999 yields 4.823 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$3.5 billion auction of its new 4.75 percent bonds due September 15, 1999 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     4.823	99.853  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     4.817	99.866  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    4.830	99.839   3.87879</p>
<p>The bonds will be dated and delivered on June 16. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$7,423.10 million, including C$57.6 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield. Proceeds of the issue will be used for general purposes.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
